{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/bc90fe889fb2bd4030f8e2795987e89c.avif?t=1755914587\" data-has-big width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/78dd2f5f63221ea27c9baf6c7d10c131.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet exciting 2.5D endless runner with a magical girl twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Maho, a high school freshman whisked into a dreamlike world of rooftops, monsters, and one very reliable Pink Sugar Bear. Guided by your fluffy companion, you\u2019ll dash across endless skylines, battle with a sprinkle of magic, and feed sweets to your foes to send them scurrying away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d98d74e2c3c566f91bb90be420cd64cf.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Platforming with a Twist \u2013 Easy to pick up, but with surprises as you get more familiar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute &amp; Cinematic \u2013 Whimsical visuals and playful monsters bring Maho\u2019s world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Mascot Guide \u2013 Pink Sugar Bear isn\u2019t just your guidance, he\u2019s your motivation to go everywhere you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Monsters! \u2013 Toss sweet Pokie sticks to turn danger into delicious score multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Rooftop Adventure \u2013 Chill at your own pace or challenge yourself with higher scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d6a1bd962f868faf8105031dd82ccd8f.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, we\u2019re focused on perfecting the endless mode and adding three new monsters to story mode. These are already in active development and will be part of the core experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/11fd0e2d784bcc609f3bf68a498681c7.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our Kickstarter is successful, we\u2019ll expand the dream with even more features \u2014 starting with a global leaderboard and additional magical surprises for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/2d78f624b4900181796a5de0b5d222bb.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny team of two (an artist + a programmer) creating Magic Maho out of love for kawaii anime magic girls and cozy indie games. This demo is just the beginning \u2014 with your feedback, we\u2019ll polish and expand the dream until the full game launches in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673730?t=1755914587","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/f86c2c5570857faaef423b7068ade2fba752a215/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755914587","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/b61fb82234cc2a991608e7d4095774648d0b8d27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755914587","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/b61fb82234cc2a991608e7d4095774648d0b8d27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755914587","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/bc90fe889fb2bd4030f8e2795987e89c.avif?t=1755914587\" data-has-big width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/78dd2f5f63221ea27c9baf6c7d10c131.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet exciting 2.5D endless runner with a magical girl twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Maho, a high school freshman whisked into a dreamlike world of rooftops, monsters, and one very reliable Pink Sugar Bear. Guided by your fluffy companion, you\u2019ll dash across endless skylines, battle with a sprinkle of magic, and feed sweets to your foes to send them scurrying away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d98d74e2c3c566f91bb90be420cd64cf.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Platforming with a Twist \u2013 Easy to pick up, but with surprises as you get more familiar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute &amp; Cinematic \u2013 Whimsical visuals and playful monsters bring Maho\u2019s world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Mascot Guide \u2013 Pink Sugar Bear isn\u2019t just your guidance, he\u2019s your motivation to go everywhere you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Monsters! \u2013 Toss sweet Pokie sticks to turn danger into delicious score multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Rooftop Adventure \u2013 Chill at your own pace or challenge yourself with higher scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d6a1bd962f868faf8105031dd82ccd8f.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, we\u2019re focused on perfecting the endless mode and adding three new monsters to story mode. These are already in active development and will be part of the core experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/11fd0e2d784bcc609f3bf68a498681c7.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our Kickstarter is successful, we\u2019ll expand the dream with even more features \u2014 starting with a global leaderboard and additional magical surprises for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/2d78f624b4900181796a5de0b5d222bb.avif?t=1755914587\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny team of two (an artist + a programmer) creating Magic Maho out of love for kawaii anime magic girls and cozy indie games. This demo is just the beginning \u2014 with your feedback, we\u2019ll polish and expand the dream until the full game launches in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Nino Studios Inc","Noah Maestre"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/dae8470ec3faa34e44013c40bd1d0e018db0e756/header.jpg?t=1755914587","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187472,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187472/movie480.mp4?t=1755914586","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187472/movie_max.mp4?t=1755914586"},"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187472/ea07e3ed63514343c24fea520f6a69adf4c7a1b3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755914586","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187472/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755914586","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187472/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755914586"}}],"name":"Magic Maho: Dream Runner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7 (SP1+) and Windows 10, 64-bit versions only.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  DX10, DX11, and DX12-capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Hardware vendor officially supported drivers</li></ul>","recommended":"<stron